{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured secure nightly backups from node2 to node1. Dated root-only archives are created under /var/backups/inventory at 02:15–02:30, with seven-day retention. Both nodes retained RHEL 10.0 and kernel 6.12.0-55.9.1.el10_0.x86_64 and passed sequential restart/recovery verification.","actions_performed":["Created the previously absent /srv/inventory/data source directory.","Configured a locked, restricted SSH transfer account with pinned host identity and forced export-only access.","Installed an atomic tar-based backup service and persistent systemd timer on node1.","Verified source-to-archive content using matching SHA-256 hashes.","Tested retention by confirming an eight-day-old archive was deleted.","Removed verification artifacts and confirmed no temporary archives remain.","Restarted node2 and node1 sequentially, verifying changed boot identities and complete recovery after each."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Nightly dated backup and destination","command_ids":["cmd-1c9352d13bb34e0d","cmd-40a1547ef53d44b7","cmd-daf0b7bf0b2b45c6"],"summary":"Source and restored hashes matched; the timer is enabled and active; the dated archive is valid and mode 0600 in the root-only destination."},{"requirement":"Retain the last seven days","command_ids":["cmd-86f5c8690c0d41c2","cmd-ea1781dcf3c94aed","cmd-daf0b7bf0b2b45c6"],"summary":"An eight-day-old test archive was removed, no temporary archives remain, and the configured policy deletes archives older than six elapsed daily intervals."},{"requirement":"Secure restricted transfer","command_ids":["cmd-c15560d931f8483b","cmd-44d7de9974584ecb","cmd-8e21d113c5684d47","cmd-61a1f3c14ec64710"],"summary":"Private key is protected, the locked account is limited by source address and forced command, and arbitrary commands are rejected with exit code 64."},{"requirement":"Preserve installed OS release and kernel","command_ids":["cmd-a163c8c689cd4ea7","cmd-bbe70683546b44d5","cmd-daf0b7bf0b2b45c6","cmd-61a1f3c14ec64710"],"summary":"Both nodes remained on RHEL 10.0 with kernel 6.12.0-55.9.1.el10_0.x86_64 before and after changes and restarts."},{"requirement":"node2 restart persistence and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-cd7b79cafd884a1f","cmd-f0bb000b1db74995","cmd-bab61307d5de4816","cmd-bae44fb7f1c9401f","cmd-d9e7d4ce1d454824"],"summary":"Captured healthy baseline, acknowledged reboot, observed boot ID change, verified SSH/source recovery and zero failed units, then completed a valid backup."},{"requirement":"node1 restart persistence and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-c1bce015512c4309","cmd-592cf716fdcd448f","cmd-265e2bea666d4c97","cmd-3a6984c917e94298"],"summary":"Captured healthy baseline, acknowledged reboot, observed boot ID change, verified the archive and timer persisted with zero failed units, then completed a fresh backup."}]}
